# Online Ordering System — Project Context

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Python 3.9 + Flask 3.x
- **ORM**: Flask-SQLAlchemy (SQLite dev / MySQL prod)；生产环境连接池默认 `pool_size=5`、`max_overflow=5`、`pool_recycle=3600`，可通过 `SQLALCHEMY_POOL_SIZE`、`SQLALCHEMY_MAX_OVERFLOW`、`SQLALCHEMY_POOL_RECYCLE` 覆盖（与 Gunicorn/Celery 进程数对齐，见 `docs/性能优化方案.md`）
- **Auth**: Flask-Login (Jinja2 pages) + Flask-JWT-Extended (REST API)
- **Cache/Rate-limit**: Flask-Caching + Flask-Limiter (Redis or memory fallback)
- **Task queue**: Celery (`celery_worker.py`, tasks in `app/tasks/`)
- **CSRF**: Flask-WTF (API blueprint exempted)
- **Deploy**: Docker Compose + Nginx + Gunicorn
- **Password policy**: `zxcvbn`（`app/password_policy.py`）；长度 8–128，至少 1 个英文字母与 1 个数字，可含符号/空格；最低 zxcvbn 分数默认 2，环境变量 `PASSWORD_ZXCVBN_MIN_SCORE`（0–4）可覆盖

## Directory Structure
```
app/
├── __init__.py        # create_app() factory, registers all extensions & blueprints
├── models.py          # All SQLAlchemy models
├── errors.py          # Custom exceptions
├── password_policy.py # 注册/改密密钥强度（规则 + zxcvbn）
├── bootstrap_admin.py # 首次空库管理员凭据（环境变量 INITIAL_ADMIN_*）
├── utils.py           # Helpers (image upload, etc.)
├── api/               # REST API blueprint (JWT auth, prefix /api)
│   ├── auth.py        # /api/auth/*
│   ├── cart.py        # /api/cart/*
│   ├── orders.py      # /api/orders/*
│   ├── restaurants.py # /api/restaurants/*
│   └── schemas.py     # marshmallow schemas
├── routes/            # Jinja2 page blueprints (Flask-Login auth)
│   ├── auth.py        # /login /register /logout
│   ├── cart.py        # /cart/*
│   ├── category.py    # /category/*
│   ├── dish.py        # /dish/*
│   ├── order.py       # /order/*
│   ├── restaurant.py  # /restaurant/*
│   └── restaurant_category.py
├── services/cart_service.py  # Cart business logic
├── tasks/order_tasks.py      # Celery async tasks
├── templates/         # Jinja2 templates (sub-dirs by feature)
└── static/            # CSS, images；`static/dist/` 可选放置带内容 hash 的构建产物（Nginx 对 `/static/dist/` 长缓存）
tests/                 # pytest (fixtures in conftest.py)
migrations/            # Flask-Migrate files
```

## Models (app/models.py)
| Model | Key Fields | Relations |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| `User` | id, username, password, role(user/admin/merchant), restaurant_id | → Address, Order, Review, CartItem |
| `Restaurant` | id, name, status(open/closed/busy/offline), is_active, delivery_fee, min_order, rating | → Dish, Order, Review, User |
| `Dish` | id, name, price, restaurant_id, category_id, is_available | → CartItem, OrderItem |
| `Category` | id, name (dish category) | → Dish |
| `RestaurantCategory` | id, name (restaurant type) | — |
| `Order` | id, user_id, restaurant_id, status, total_price, address | → OrderItem, Review |
| `OrderItem` | id, order_id, dish_id, quantity, price | — |
| `CartItem` | id, user_id, dish_id, quantity | — |
| `Review` | id, user_id, restaurant_id, order_id, rating, comment | — |
| `Address` | id, user_id, name, phone, address, is_default | — |

## Conventions
- **API response**: `{'code': 200, 'message': '...', 'data': {...}}`
- **Rate limit**: global 200 req/min/IP; stricter on sensitive endpoints (login, etc.)
- **Image upload**: saved to `app/static/images/{dishes|logos|banners}/`, return relative path
- **Roles**: `user` / `merchant` (restaurant admin) / `admin` (superadmin)
- **Blueprint prefix**: Jinja2 pages — none; REST API — `/api`
- **Password (register / change)**: 服务端 `validate_password()`；登录不重新校验 zxcvbn
- **Bootstrap admin**: 首次空库由 `entrypoint`/`init_data` 使用 `get_initial_admin_credentials()`；生产须设置 `INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD`；演示用户 `testuser` 仅 `SEED_DEMO_USERS=1` 或 `FLASK_ENV=development`

